---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Cookie Policy — GetFOSS"
  description="Learn how GetFOSS uses cookies and browser storage."
  canonicalPath="/cookies/"
>
  <main class="content-shell">
    <article class="prose">
      <header class="page-header">
        <p class="eyebrow">LEGAL</p>
        <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
        <p class="lede">GetFOSS keeps browser storage to a minimum and does not use advertising or analytics cookies.</p>
      </header>

      <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> November 26, 2026</p>

      <h2>1. What Are Cookies?</h2>
      <p>Cookies are small text files that websites may store in your browser. They are commonly used to remember preferences, maintain sessions, and understand how visitors use a website.</p>

      <h2>2. How GetFOSS Uses Browser Storage</h2>
      <p>GetFOSS uses browser local storage to remember your selected color palette. This allows the website to keep your preferred appearance when you return.</p>
      <p>This preference is stored locally in your browser and is not used to identify you.</p>

      <h2>3. Analytics and Advertising</h2>
      <p>GetFOSS does not intentionally use analytics cookies, advertising cookies, or behavioral tracking technologies.</p>

      <h2>4. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>GetFOSS is hosted on GitHub Pages. The hosting provider may use its own technologies and process technical information necessary to deliver and secure the website.</p>
      <p>External websites linked from GetFOSS may use their own cookies and tracking technologies. Their practices are governed by their respective policies.</p>

      <h2>5. Managing Browser Storage</h2>
      <p>You can clear local storage and cookies through your browser settings. Clearing local storage will reset your saved color palette preference.</p>

      <h2>6. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Cookie Policy when website functionality or applicable requirements change. The latest version will be available on this page.</p>

      <h2>7. Contact</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about this policy, contact us at <a href="mailto:info@getfoss.org">info@getfoss.org</a>.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
